pi.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-06-29T02:28:49Z","updated_at":"2026-07-04T16:28:54Z","closed_at":"2026-07-04T16:14:42Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120725","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120725","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120725.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120725.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-04T16:14:41Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nmbedTLS 4.1 is the new LTS branch (supported until at least March 2029), the mbedTLS 3.6 branch (currently used by Godot) is not guaranteed to be supported after March 2027.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nHere be dragons!\r\n\r\nSince mbedTLS 4, the library have been split into a separate TF-PSA-Crypto repository, with mbedTLS only acting as an X.509 and TLS library (TF-PSA-Crypto is still bundled in mbedTLS releases).\r\n\r\nThe TF-PSA-Crypto library is the reference implementation for the PSA Cryptography API, an attempt by ARM to standardize cryptographic APIs.\r\n\r\nWhile I commend the attempt, the usual \"new standard\" meme applies.\r\n\r\nThis commit refactor the CryptoCore and mbedtls module code to use the PSA API, using mbedTLS proper for TLS, X.509, base64 and RSA/EC parsing.\r\n\r\nThere are some quirks/changes due to this:\r\n\r\n- **breaking change** The `AESContext::get_iv_state` function now always returns and empty PackedByteArray since extracting the IV state from a PSA cipher operation is not currently possible.\r\n\r\n- The CryptoCore random generation function now has an implicit global lock due to the underlying `psa_generate_random` usage.\r\n\r\n- The PSA Crypto API is very opinionated when it comes to key usage and does not allow to change usage after a key is imported. For this reason `CryptoKey`s need to be reimported with the correct usage flags before performing different cryptographic operations. The current implementation does so transparently sacrificing some performance for simplicity (and compatibility).\r\n\r\n~This PR drops compatibility with previous mbedTLS versions.~\r\n\r\n~It might be possible to restore compatibility with mbedTLS 3.6, but given EOL is planned for March 2027 it might not be worth the extra preprocessor boilerplate.~\r\n\r\nEDIT: *This commit drops compatibility with the mbedTLS 2.8 branch (EOL since the end of 2024), but retain compatibility with the mbedTLS 3.6 branch (expected EOL March 2027).*\r\n\r\n## AI Disclosure\r\n\r\n**TL;DR; No clanker has been used to generate code for this PR.**\r\n\r\nAll code changes outside `thirdparty/mbedtls/` code are 100% hand-crafted.\r\n\r\nThe code in `thirdparty/mbedtls/godot` is also written by me.\r\n\r\nThe third-party code (mbedTLS, TF-PSA-Crypto) is AFAIU covered by the [Trusted Firmware AI Policy](https://www.trustedfirmware.org/aipolicy/)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120725/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120725/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}